{
  "_about": "Analytical techniques and the instrument settings recorded for each (the 'analysis' step, stages/analysis.py; 2026-11-07). A value goes in the column analysis_<technique>_<setting>[_<unit>] -- e.g. analysis_MALDI-TOF-MS_laser-intensity_%, analysis_RP-HPLC_flow-rate_mL_min, analysis_RP-HPLC_column (text). Technique and setting names use hyphens inside, underscores only between the parts, like the compound columns (<role>_<name>_<phase>_<measure>). A technique listed here with one of its families' settings (or a 'general' one) is a known column; anything else is offered in the review under Analysis. Families and settings follow Rouessac & Rouessac, Chemical Analysis: Modern Instrumentation Methods and Techniques, 3rd ed. (Wiley 2022), chapters 1-22, plus the settings prebiotic-chemistry papers report (Riggi2023's MALDI Table 2, kim2017's HPLC, the Sam Papers set). Units: the unit the column holds (values are converted from the unit printed); '' = text. 'integer': a whole number.",
